<title>NAMIBIA: SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT NAMIBIA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT NAMIBIA 3-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt beat Namibia 3-2 (halftime 0-0) in their World cup group qualifying match at the Independent stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Namibia - China Utoni 61, Mohamed Ouseb 87 penalty.</p>
<p>Egypt - Hadi Kassaba 76 penalty, Hussein Hassan 80</p>
<p>Al Hadi 89</p>
</text>
